The replacement was again Grok and timed out a second time; the harness’s distinct-vendor scheduling leaves Grok as the only eligible substitute for this slot until its retry cap is exhausted. I’ll let the script follow its own policy rather than altering the oracle pool mid-run.
diff --git a/gen_0911_1393.py b/gen_0911_1393.py
